      "id": "IK-188721101:L80",
      "source_document": "188721101",
      "original_line": 80,
      "text": "3. Petitioner in support of her case examined her attorney, Sh. M.L. Jain as PW-1, who supported the petition. Petitioner also examined two other witnesses, who were shopkeepers having their shops in the vicinity. Both the witnesses deposed that Sh. Bhagwan Dass was running the shop and not respondent Sh. Ramesh Kumar.",
      "provenance": [
        {
          "document_id": "188721101",
          "url": "https://indiankanoon.org/doc/188721101/",
          "response_index": 0,
          "raw_path": "outputs/rgcn-data-expansion-09/continuation-01/open-188721101-0.txt",
          "raw_sha256": "9f24acff31fcdb4e628f40dc375c31b2f4910478a5d98db6f0709b972515c208",
          "raw_char_range": [
            4720,
            5040
          ],
          "raw_byte_range": [
            4854,
            5174
          ],
          "raw_physical_line": 78,
